#import "../utils.typst": linear_translation

#linear_translation(
[שִׁ֗יר הַֽמַּ֫עֲל֥וֹת בְּשׁ֣וּב יְ֭הֹוָה אֶת־שִׁיבַ֣ת צִיּ֑וֹן הָ֝יִ֗ינוּ כְּחֹלְמִֽים׃],
[A Song of Ascents. When Adonoy returns the captivity of Tzion, we were like dreamers.])

#linear_translation(
[אָ֤ז יִמָּלֵ֪א שְׂח֡וֹק פִּינוּ֮ וּלְשׁוֹנֵ֢נוּ רִ֫נָּ֥ה אָ֭ז יֹאמְר֣וּ בַגּוֹיִ֑ם הִגְדִּ֥יל יְ֝הֹוָ֗ה לַעֲשׂ֥וֹת עִם־אֵֽלֶּה׃ ],
[Then our mouth will be filled with laughter, and our tongue with songs of joy; then they will say among the nations: "Adonoy has done great things for these."])

#linear_translation(
[הִגְדִּ֣יל יְ֭הֹוָה לַעֲשׂ֥וֹת עִמָּ֗נוּ הָיִ֥ינוּ שְׂמֵחִֽים׃],
[Adonoy has done great things for us; we were glad.])

#linear_translation(
[שׁוּבָ֣ה יְ֭הֹוָה אֶת־שְׁבִיתֵ֑נוּ כַּאֲפִיקִ֥ים בַּנֶּֽגֶב׃ ],
[Return, Adonoy, our captivity, like streams in the Negev.])

#linear_translation(
[הַזֹּרְעִ֥ים בְּדִמְעָ֗ה בְּרִנָּ֥ה יִקְצֹֽרוּ׃],
[Those who sow in tears shall reap with songs of joy.])

#linear_translation(
[הָ֘ל֚וֹךְ יֵלֵ֨ךְ | וּבָכֹה֘ נֹשֵׂ֪א מֶֽשֶׁךְ־הַ֫זָּ֥רַע בֹּֽא־יָבֹ֥א בְרִנָּ֑ה נֹ֜שֵׂ֗א אֲלֻמֹּתָֽיו:],
[He who goes along weeping, carrying the bag of seed, shall surely return with songs of joy, bearing his sheaves.])
